(21) [step 17] [finish]
Fixed month lower bound in _get_low_from_current_date_number so anchored */step month ranges stay 1-based: changed `dt.month % step` to `((dt.month - 1) % step) + 1`, matching the day field's semantics. The previously failing case `croniter('0 0 1 */3 *', datetime(2024,6,1), expand_from_start_time=True)` now returns 2024-09-01. Full test suite (218 tests) passes, anchored minutes/hours/days behavior is unchanged, and non-anchored month step parsing is unaffected.

